  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrappers for the kubectl CLI — Apply, Get, Delete, Describe, Rollout (Status/Restart/Undo), PortForward, Logs, Exec, Scale, SetImage. Common settings cover --context / --namespace / --kubeconfig / --as / --dry-run / -o so adopters don't reinvent the cross-cutting knobs per verb. Unpinned name (kubectl's CLI surface is backward-compatible across releases per Kubernetes deprecation policy).",
